  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="commodity_rafter_cb48b54813b5de103f9fb90874a821e8f511bfb29aaeed908fdc4e564181c3dec5">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>in error for rafter, one of the beams which give slope and form to a roof (OED s.v. rafter n.^1) as raster is attested only in compounds raster cloth (barber’s towel) raster house (barber’s shop) (OED s.v. raster n.^1). Note that the Cologne translation describes this product as a beam or spar for a house (balken oder haussparren)</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
    <crm:P2_has_type rdf:resource="http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435416"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E33_Linguistic_Object"/>
  </rdf:Description>
